cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this recipe or write about it, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Capsule Google Booking: free appointment scheduling for Capsule CRM on Google Calendar booking pages"
abstract: >-
  A recipe for free appointment scheduling in Capsule CRM using Google Calendar
  appointment schedules. A form on your own page captures the visitor and their
  UTM attribution, Google's booking page takes the slot, and a calendar watcher
  moves the Capsule opportunity to Meeting Booked. Runs as one Google Apps Script
  for a single person or two n8n workflows for a team.
